Design: I propose to enhance our test‐time augmentation by adding vertical flips and combined horizontal+vertical flips, yielding four TTA variants (original, h‐flip, v‐flip, hv‐flip) and averaging their feature representations. This should improve the model’s invariance to orientation and boost generalization without changing the overall pipeline. The rest of the LightGBM cross‐validation, retraining, and prediction logic remains unchanged.
