-------------------------------
Design: I propose to extend the test‐time augmentation by including vertical flips in addition to the existing horizontal flips, yielding four flip states (none, horizontal, vertical, both) combined with the four rotations (0°, 90°, 180°, 270°) for a total of 16 deterministic TTA variants. We will update `extract_features_tta` to loop over these flip configurations and rotations, average the extracted ViT features over all 16 transforms, and then proceed with the LightGBM 5‐fold CV and final training as before. This broader orientation augmentation should improve feature robustness and boost the overall AUROC without changing the core training pipeline.
